    "classification": "offline-tinykg-cli-lock-denied-before-graph-activation",
    "detail": "The sequence-4 offline TinyKG child received the integrated Markdown memory and all three KG tool schemas, but its first provider request had Memory=true and Knowledge Graph=false. Replaying the exact pinned TinyKG store-info command under the frozen Seatbelt profile returns PermissionDenied, while the same command outside Seatbelt succeeds and releases <store>/.tinykg-cli.lock.",
    "root_cause": "The offline store root was sealed against every write. TinyKG serializes even read-only CLI commands by creating the transient <store>/.tinykg-cli.lock directory, so metacodes degraded the KG client before building the system prompt. The sandbox probe checked store bytes but never executed the real read-only CLI path before durable budget authorization.",
